    "created_at": "2024-01-14T21:48:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-01-14T21:48:49Z",
    "body": "For options `A` and `B`, the new properties would reflect the current state of the sum of the `URL` components, so if modifying a setter value changes the validity of the URL, the property would be changed to reflect that. ",
