    "updated_at": "2024-01-15T15:55:51Z",
    "body": "> It would likely be useful for the API to provide some reasonable means of handling validity state.\r\n\r\nI think we need to start with flushing this out more. See also 1 of https://whatwg.org/faq#adding-new-features.",
